---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Business Information - CloudDroid" description="Business verification, legal entity details, and KYB information for CloudDroid payment processors and enterprise customers.">
  <div class="bg-slate-light py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-navy mb-4">Business Information</h1>
      <p class="text-slate text-lg">Legal entity details, ownership structure, and compliance information for merchant onboarding and enterprise due diligence.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate mt-2">Effective date: 23 August 2026. Last updated: 23 August 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Legal Entity</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Legal Name</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy">RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o.</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Company ID (IČO)</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy">23389702</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">VAT ID (DIČ)</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-navy">CZ23389702</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Legal Form</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">Limited Liability Company</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Registered Address</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">Soukenická 877/9<br>Ostrava, 702 00<br>Czech Republic</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Correspondence Address</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">Soukenická 877/9<br>Ostrava, 702 00<br>Czech Republic</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Registration</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">Registered in the Commercial Register of the Czech Republic</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Business Activity</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Primary Business</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">CloudDroid provides enterprise-grade cloud Android workspaces for QA automation, mobile app testing, and secure remote productivity.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Services</div>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-navy space-y-1">
              <li>Cloud-hosted Android workspaces</li>
              <li>QA automation and app testing environments</li>
              <li>ADB access and CI/CD support</li>
              <li>Session recording and audit logging</li>
              <li>Compliance-ready access controls</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Target Market</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">Enterprise customers, QA teams, mobile app developers, and organizations requiring secure remote Android environments. Primary markets: European Union and global.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Revenue Model</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">Subscription-based SaaS model with monthly and annual billing tiers. No one-time purchases or pay-per-use models.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Ownership & Management</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Company Structure</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o. is a Czech limited liability company with a single shareholder structure. The company is wholly owned and operated by its founding members.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Beneficial Owners</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">The beneficial owners are the founding members of RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o. No other natural persons hold 25% or more of the shares or voting rights.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Directors</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">The company is managed by its appointed directors in accordance with Czech corporate law. Director details are available upon request for compliance purposes.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Contact Information</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Support Email</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">support@clouddroid.eu</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">DPO / Privacy Contact</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">dpo@clouddroid.eu</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Phone</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">+420 734 210 456</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Compliance Contact</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">support@clouddroid.eu</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Website</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">https://clouddroid.eu</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Response Time</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">Within 2 business days</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Banking & Payouts</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Bank Account</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">Bank account is held in the name of RUNESTONE HANDLUNG s.r.o. at a Czech licensed banking institution. Account details are provided to payment processors during KYB onboarding.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Currency</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">EUR (Euro) and USD (US Dollar) via payment processors</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Settlement</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">Settlement is handled by Dodo Payments and Mollie according to their standard payout schedules. CloudDroid does not hold customer funds directly.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Compliance & Risk</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">PCI DSS</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">We do not store, process, or transmit raw card data. All payment processing is handled by PCI DSS compliant payment processors (Dodo Payments, Mollie).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">GDPR</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">We process personal data in accordance with GDPR. Data minimization, purpose limitation, and data subject rights are core principles of our privacy framework.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">AML / CFT</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">We do not provide anonymous or pseudonymous services. Customer identities are verified at onboarding. We cooperate with authorities and payment processors on AML/CFT matters.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-navy mb-2">Sanctions</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate">We do not do business with individuals or entities on sanctions lists. We screen customers against applicable sanctions regimes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">Operational Overview</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Founded</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">2024</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Infrastructure</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-navy">CloudDroid operates on cloud infrastructure with containerized Android workspaces. All data is encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256).</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Uptime</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">We target 99.9% uptime for production services. Enterprise tier subscriptions include formal SLA commitments.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Support</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-navy">Email support at support@clouddroid.eu with documented response expectations. Enterprise customers receive priority support.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy mb-6">For Payment Processors & Due Diligence</h2>
        <div class="bg-navy/5 border border-navy/20 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-navy">This page is provided to assist with KYB (Know Your Business) verification, merchant onboarding, and due diligence requests from payment processors, financial institutions, and enterprise customers.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy">For additional documentation, verification letters, or specific compliance questionnaires, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@clouddroid.eu" class="underline">support@clouddroid.eu</a> with your request and reference number.</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy">We typically respond within 2 business days and can provide additional documentation including: proof of company registration, proof of address, director identification, and bank confirmation letters.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
